{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"s4636c6074fcbbf3d","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-477bc35b6cb510ccac2c","text":"[开拓者]乘客，随着旅途的展开，列车上来了很多新伙伴呢","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-a2267c3d0d847a8f47b2","text":"我也注意到了！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-6e750f08348b16753a3b","text":"我也注意到了！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-3f05c7d5f7cb8729a017","text":"旅途的收获！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-7554bd69eadbcf2be706","text":"这就是旅途的收获吧！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-2333cf1bcdb32ef7797b","text":"嗯嗯，一定要珍惜这些相遇！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-84502206ec0faee8d58c","text":"为了留下美好的回忆，列车专门给各位新伙伴准备了可以留言的登记簿","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-5d6e5c0142c5375ca0b6","text":"访客登记簿就放在吧台上，有空可以去看看帕！","speaker":"帕姆"}]}
